# Derived photograph ladder (preview/scripts/derive-photos.mjs). Regenerated from
# the committed originals on every build — 311 WebP files that would otherwise
# churn in the diff every time a photograph is swapped. The MANIFEST beside them
# (preview/src/data/photo-manifest.json) IS committed: the typecheck and the test
# suite read it, and both run before the build that would regenerate it.
preview/public/d/
